--- !u!114 &5744694507999274649
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2263727724354554929}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5b72b968ab35b7747863b866328637d6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuizManagerArun
  questions:
  - questionText: '1. Tenali Raman was known for which qualities? '
    option1: He was the master of the magic arts.
    option2: B. He was skilled in all forms of archery.
    option3: C. He was angry and arrogant.
    option4: D. He was witty, intelligent and scholarly.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 1
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 560098950c48da84688cd710d69ad45a, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: c8490dbdf72414b48afedde461195505, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
  - questionText: 2. Who was King Krishnadevaraya?
    option1: A. The King of Hastinapura.
    option2: B. The King of Vijayanagara.
    option3: C. The King of Ayodhya.
    option4: D. The King of Mithila.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 1
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f116222baa8ede849862571ed0c1ca32, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 1a13feb4d9b25354090b4f54a0b5a5e4, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 3
  - questionText: 3. How did Raman come to be known as Tenali Raman?
    option1: A. After his father's death, his mother took him to a city called Chittoor.
    option2: B. After his mother's death, his father took him to a city called Tenali.
    option3: C. After his father's death, his mother took him to a city called Tenali.
    option4: D. Tenali was a family name.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 1
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4fdd1d07cee458c4f8b5fe0fcd10c587, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 2faf6edefe9b80b41a776244487579d7, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
  - questionText: 4. At one time, the village of Tenali suffered from...
    option1: A. ...drought.
    option2: B. ...disease.
    option3: C. ...hurricane.
    option4: 'D. ...snow storms. '
    option1IsCorrect: 1
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7ef862ae3da14ee44956351cca2967c9, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 001bf4b5122dadf47ab63abcb0b8b09e, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
  - questionText: 5. Why did the villagers trust the visiting Saint like a god?
    option1: A. They believed that the presence of the Saint and repeated chants
      will eliminate the misfortune.
    option2: B. They believed that the presence of the Saint will control rains.
    option3: C. The Saint was Thor in disguise.
    option4: D. The Saint taught them divine Mantras.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 1
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6bcdb10791a9d4c45b1327c8f9a34a5d, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: f54f265513ced9340ad6fe7966fbbd25, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
  - questionText: 6. What did the Saint teach Tenali Raman?
    option1: A. A few mantras to chant to Lakshmi Devi.
    option2: B. A few mantras to chant to Durga Devi.
    option3: C. A few mantras to chant to Kali Devi.
    option4: D. A few mantras to chant to Surya Devi.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 1
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e1d0a0f8b87c1f44bab536bdae41d02, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 23a6a20fbffc376478897af41dd333ad, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 3.5
  - questionText: 7. What did the Saint say would happen?
    option1: A. That Kali Devi would bless Raman and give him the boon to become
      strong.
    option2: B. That Kali Devi would bless Raman and give him the boon to become
      famous.
    option3: C. That Saraswati Devi would bless Raman and give him the boon to become
      famous.
    option4: D. That Lakshmi Devi would bless Raman and give him the boon to become
      rich.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 1
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 0
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 15240aba1260a7745b98098db26996b3, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 3f931fcc65938ea4ea89fafb4b416d9c, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
  - questionText: 8. Tenali Raman displayed an intelligent quality. What was it?
    option1: A. While others prayed to the Saint, Tenali Raman refused to bow.
    option2: B. Tenali Raman made fun of the Saint and insulted him.
    option3: C. While others questioned the logic, Tenali Raman believed.
    option4: D. While others blindly believed, Tenali Raman questioned the logic.
    option1IsCorrect: 0
    option2IsCorrect: 0
    option3IsCorrect: 0
    option4IsCorrect: 1
    questionAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b669f1ea231c34b44b0fc91a141302de, type: 3}
    questionVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 4e3d82574f2deba479f948a44c1244d0, type: 3}
    optionStartTime: 4
